{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0503_1000_null", "source_sha256": "b96819e56b6645ec2e7860a353c6fe5526537c170bf826c66e45d5e2ac58eadd", "ja": "第1回定期公演初日、開演直前……", "zh": "第1次定期公演首日，开演前夕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0503_1001_401pro", "source_sha256": "4fbd6fb9818869afa82b7ba70b2010c88ddae7ba7d3997a14be87c97b20b5798", "ja": "設営、OK。サウンドチェック、OK。\n……よし、電気系統も大丈夫だな！", "zh": "场地布置，OK。音响检查，OK。\n……好，电气系统也没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0503_1003_401pro", "source_sha256": "ff56694bef92f7658aec5f21320ed1c1f1915aec2972d5d0bf0f93523ced4789", "ja": "あれ？　未来、まだいたのか。\nこっちは終わったけど……？", "zh": "咦？未来，你还在啊。\n我这边已经结束了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0503_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "bf3a332ca6411fed0c8154b744e9e63da2057eafd55c80099b0b5fff4b2a73e7", "ja": "あ、プロデューサーさん。\nごめんなさい、すぐ楽屋に戻ります。", "zh": "啊，制作人。\n对不起，我马上回休息室。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0503_1005_401pro", "source_sha256": "e13c036a43e89a44031fd393157f20a0627a8b67cb34c3e21fa5a9168f4f91b3", "ja": "？、何か気になることでもあるのか？\n遠慮しないで、何でも言ってくれていいんだぞ。", "zh": "嗯？是有什么在意的事吗？别客气，什么都可以跟我说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0503_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "83e5426fc03b8f9fd25e2a2a8f2b9929bb965e5b7c5b1ceec8be7a56d35fe1ee", "ja": "いえ、そういうんじゃなくて。\nちょっと思い出してたんです。", "zh": "不是，不是那回事。\n我只是想起了一些事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0503_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "314da5b43c5f1ae44d298db97dcf8f7b6f1144db8132147144d1ed2943535eb2", "ja": "少し前は、私も客席にいたんだな～って。", "zh": "不久之前，我也还是坐在观众席上的呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0503_1008_401pro", "source_sha256": "3f1c7d545ec8a7ab903153bbbbe7c1d1086f8dbecb531bf5e670e749e914a9bd", "ja": "ああ……、そうだったな。", "zh": "啊……是啊，确实是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0503_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "6172dc901e7618e213256ed63d41e777a37a1b8e047fd54e4d037d43d290f155", "ja": "劇場って、お客さんの顔がよく見えますよね。\n一番後ろの席まで、ハッキリと。", "zh": "在剧场里，能清楚地看到客人的脸呢。\n就连最后一排的座位，也能看得一清二楚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0503_1010_401pro", "source_sha256": "ef2fda26d76851f70ea157e078f2970c4457cab8a11e4e3c714c63adc2e05022", "ja": "ああ。お客さんひとりひとりと、\nしっかり目を合わせてあげてくれ。", "zh": "是啊。要和每一位观众好好对视。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0503_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "9e31753c5115cc854619093dcb5db8a92bdb69801c388ce7861473f7a69ecf2a", "ja": "未来から見えてるってことは、\nお客さんにも見えてるってことだからな。", "zh": "既然未来能看见，那就说明客人们也能看见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0503_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "20df153c33050de8a649c4662a8c0486aa2a5cb44b2afe5a876e13c957b7da20", "ja": "はい！　今日は来てくれた人、\n全員の顔を覚えるつもりで頑張ります！", "zh": "好！今天我要努力记住每一位到场观众的脸！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0503_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "3183feea8bb311a9c3374d4997fc244f9dd45346b402710976bafa37da66a6b3", "ja": "あっ、今日だけじゃダメですよね。\nこれから公演するたびに、毎回、ずーっと……。", "zh": "啊，不能只看今天呢。\n今后每次公演，都要一直……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0503_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "2e25267a006504daca922fd94d894400f1ea76908c8321f1dc5b65741ea1eabf", "ja": "プロデュ―サーさん！\nよく考えたら、ちょっと全員は無理かも！？", "zh": "制作人先生！仔细想想，可能有点没法记住所有人吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0503_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "4f31cdb34eb1148bdff5a97c40fc53bb9bcb4e4d9f0eb821771c60530ae4f123", "ja": "そ、そうだな。毎回全員は無理だと思う。\nというか、顔は無理に覚えなくても大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "嗯、说得也是。我觉得每次要记住所有人，确实有点困难。\n或者说，不用勉强去记住每个人的长相也没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0503_1016_401pro", "source_sha256": "deaa4e4b49aac7203b0e3110b8aec21ab8ce435f4325d8915ec24756e04d5a8b", "ja": "きっと、公演するたびに少しずつ積み重なって、\n自然と心に残って、覚えていくものだと思う。", "zh": "我想，每次公演一点一点积累下来，就会自然而然地留在心里，慢慢记住了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0503_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "fd5848b5f1df8aea92eaa4b739c126dee0125ba7bc37a2f186ac4ecdbc790f84", "ja": "その積み重ねが、未来の成長そのものだから。\nひとつひとつ、ステージを大切に積み重ねていこう。", "zh": "正是这些点滴积累，构成了未来的成长本身。\n让我们珍惜每一个舞台，一步一个脚印地走下去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0503_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "285447baefa57eee81b156802ed84af522cab6e70d08eb02a38526f453292adb", "ja": "はいっ。じゃあステージをひとつひとつ重ねて、\nお客さんの顔も自然と覚えて、ぐんぐん成長して……。", "zh": "好的！那就一步一步积累舞台经验，自然而然记住客人们的脸，不断不断地成长……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0503_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "06bf21bbbb0b17f9af149ba32dc2adfb02b45368eb24d762ab8aa1f92f7dcb20", "ja": "いつかはトップアイドル！　ですね！", "zh": "总有一天会成为顶尖偶像！对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0503_1020_401pro", "source_sha256": "9c5f705312bbd39a8239d8dbfc3bd265fa0c0cea795dbc249df29e17c22b08ac", "ja": "トップアイドルか……。うん！\nこの劇場から、みんなで頂点を目指していこう！", "zh": "顶级偶像吗……嗯！\n就从这座剧场出发，大家一起向顶点努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0503_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "02bfe78b156efa4ec35c6619b46218544839cfc6f5cbbf33b62861558bcb4d34", "ja": "よーし、やるぞー！\n春日未来、ファイトー！　オー！！", "zh": "好——要上了！\n春日未来，加油——！　哦！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0503_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "0f42cb9e45deff14d1489c82493aca5e26c3ac41925a3c55cebe0633f3a065e6", "ja": "うーん、やっぱり、ひとりでやってもイマイチかも。\nちょっと8thのみんなの所に行ってきます！", "zh": "嗯——果然还是一个人做的话，总觉得差点意思。\n我去一趟8th的大家那里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0503_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "4ae4e244138ef94c58e270ee4ddb04521ec0c422abca4ad00c93579c4b90848e", "ja": "みんな～、声出ししようよ～！\n……あれ、私達の掛け声って何だっけ？", "zh": "大家～，一起喊起来吧～！\n……咦，我们的口号是什么来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
